2026-11-28T07:39:44.0597655Z CARR_WINDOWS_TEXT {"artifact":15254290696,"mode":"main","path":"full-bundle-reader-keymap.txt","bytes":2827,"sha256":"6cf4ee3a85dc16098bdf13398f22d1349b7fa2ed8e8ac24581feae0baf494367","encoding":"utf-8-sig","complete_text":true,"text":"READER_KEYMAP_PHASE starting\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE modal reader opens the first exact source\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE reader is tested in a real native modal context\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE reader exposes the shared configurable command adapter\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE reader and keyboard modules load from the installed distribution\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE actual Ctrl+PageDown opens the next source\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE actual Ctrl+PageUp opens the previous source\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE actual Where am I shortcut focuses the named native location control\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE actual bookmark shortcut persists the current source location\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE shared chord dispatches to Reader bookmarks in the modal context\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE actual Reader shortcut settings save through native chooser and text controls\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE old next shortcut is inactive after remapping\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE new next shortcut dispatches the real source navigation\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE unmodified previous shortcut still works after remapping\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE native keyboard guide reports the current remapped shortcut\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE an explicitly unassigned action has neither old nor custom key\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE a rejected native-context collision preserves saved choices\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE editing and screen-reader protected assignments leave the keymap unchanged\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE ordinary typing and Insert do not navigate or change the read-only original\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE shortcut cannot bypass an explicitly disabled native command\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE reader operation is held while its native commands are disabled\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE busy native shortcuts neither open prompts nor clear pending cancellation\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE cancelled work leaves the displayed and persisted source unchanged\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE reset removes the custom native shortcut\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE reset restores the default native shortcut\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE keyboard reading preserves the unsaved host note and citation state\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE custom Reader key is saved through the shared preference store\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE actual Escape closes the modal Reader\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE a reopened native Reader restores the measured source location\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE the reopened source has native focus\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE reopen preserves removal of the old default key\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE persisted custom key drives the reopened production dialog\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE reopened Reader closes through actual Escape\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE all original source pages remain unchanged after remap, clear, reset and reopen\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE host accepts native keyboard focus after Reader closes\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE same chord invokes the host context only after Reader closes\r\nREADER_KEYMAP_PHASE complete\r\n"}
